@verifier` (only if `@anim` is already done; otherwise `@anim` will wake `@verifier` after docs sync — check `read_board` first!). Tag `@coordinator` only if blocked.\\n\\nMISSION — Fix Stale Clay Mux \\u0026 Build Telemetry-Driven F1 V6 Hybrid Audio Layer:\\n1) Immediate Clay Mux Refresh:\\n   - `renders_v5/clay_frames/f_0001.jpg`..`f_2161.jpg` finished rendering today at 13:19, while `f1_silverstone_clay_silent.mp4` and `f1_silverstone_clay_1080p.mp4` are stale from yesterday.\\n   - Run `ffmpeg` to encode fresh `renders_v5/f1_silverstone_clay_silent.mp4` and `renders_v5/f1_silverstone_clay_1080p.mp4` (24 fps, libx264 `-crf 18`, `+faststart`), and generate an updated 26-shot clay contact sheet `renders_v5/clay_stills/contact_sheet_clay.jpg` from `clay_frames`.\\n2) Telemetry-Synced F1 V6 Turbo-Hybrid Audio Synthesizer (`pipeline/synth_sfx.py`):\\n   - Solve the major missing feature noted in `docs/README_V5.md` §8 (\\\"没有引擎声：片子只有配乐。要加需要 RPM/涡轮/换挡音效层，按 gear 和时间轴对齐\\\").\\n   - Read `track_data/silverstone_track.json` (`t`, `v_mps`, `curv_1pm`, `s`, `racing_xy`) and read the 26-shot timeline \\u0026 camera positions/types from `pipeline/v5_anim.py` (read-only) so the audio matches the exact 2161 frames (`FPS=24`, total `2161/24 = 90.0417 s`, time mapping `t_sim = f_idx * (LAP_S / 2160)`).\\n   - Synthesize `renders_v5/sfx_engine_90s.wav` (48 kHz, 16-bit stereo WAV) using Python (`numpy`/`scipy` if installed, or fast vectorized Python/math):\\n     * Realistic 8-speed F1 gearbox curve (shifts across ~80..331 km/h, keeping RPM in the authentic 9,800–12,600 RPM powerband), throttle load driven by longitudinal acceleration `dv/dt`;\\n     * Rich F1 1.6L V6 hybrid timbre: fundamental `RPM/60 * 3` Hz + odd/even exhaust harmonics + formant/bandpass resonator (no harsh pure-sine buzz!) + MGU-H turbo whistle (~2.5–5.5 kHz subtle sheen) + crisp ~45 ms upshift ignition-cut pop + rapid downshift rev-match throttle blips under braking;\\n     * High-speed aerodynamic wind rush (`~ v^2`), subtle kerb rumble vibration when cornering hard (`|curv| \\u003e 0.008`), and **camera-perspective acoustic modeling** across all 26 shots:\\n       - `Onboard` (`S02`, `S19`): raw cockpit intake presence + wind;\\n       - `Fixed` trackside (`S04`, `S08`, `S11`, `S13`, `S17`, `S20`, `S24`): genuine physical **Doppler pitch shift** (`c / (c + v_radial)`) + distance attenuation + stereo left-to-right pan as the car screams past the camera!\\n       - `Chase` / `Orbit` / `WheelMacro`: punchy rear-exhaust presence (`WheelMacro` adds tire/kerb detail);\\n       - `Heli` / `Aerial`: wider reverb/air distance attenuation;\\n       - Smooth ~50 ms equal-power crossfades across shot cuts so zero clicks/pops occur.\\n3) Soundtrack Mixing \\u0026 Final MP4 Muxing:\\n   - Mix `renders_v5/audio_v5_90s.m4a` (The Weeknd - After Hours) with `renders_v5/sfx_engine_90s.wav` into `renders_v5/audio_v5_sfx_mix_90s.m4a` (AAC 256k): balanced so both the 108 BPM music and the F1 V6 engine/shifts/pass-bys shine clearly without muddying or clipping (true peak \\u003c= -1.0 dBFS, smooth 1.5 s fade-out at end).\\n   - Update `pipeline/mux_v5.sh` and `pipeline/mux_clay.sh` cleanly so running them builds silent, music-only, AND `*_sfx_1080p.mp4` variants; produce `renders_v5/f1_silverstone_clay_sfx_1080p.mp4` and `renders_v5/f1_silverstone_lap_sfx_1080p.mp4` right now and verify streams/durations/loudness with `ffprobe`/`ffmpeg -af volumedetect`.\\n4) Post exact file sizes, durations, loudness stats, and reproduction commands to `@anim`!\",\"time\":\"2026-11-18 13:25:57\",\"kind\":\"brief\",\"request_id\":\"4b7e4666-d6d3-4f12-a004-edde7f7b3df4\"},{\"seq\":5,\"agent\":\"coordinator\",\"text\":\"@monitor You are this swarm's stall monitor. Load the swarm_monitor skill and follow it. Post only to break a stall.\",\"time\":\"2026-11-18 13:25:59\",\"kind\":\"brief\",\"request_id\":\"0c7cbc5c-d27e-4aa6-b5fb-4839d72a91cf\"}],\"head\":5}\n(no newline at end of file)"}
{"step_index":13,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-18T05:26:11Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-18T13:26:11+08:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-18T13:26:11+08:00\nShowing lines 1-800 of 1276\n1: # -*- coding: utf-8 -*-\r\n2: \"\"\"\r\n3: V5 ENV — 真实赛道环境（Silverstone / OpenStreetMap 几何）\r\n4: 输入: pipeline/v4_stage_rig.blend   (模型 + 骨架，无环境无动画)\r\n5: 输出: LATEST/v5_stage_env.blend\r\n6: 运行: blender -b -P pipeline/v5_env.py\r\n7: \r\n8: 要点\r\n9:   - 路面/路肩/缓冲带/护栏/看台/维修区全部按真实赛道中心线生成（2 m 采样，闭环）\r\n10:   - 弯道位置由真实曲率决定，不是手摆的\r\n11:   - 光照重做：低角度硬光 + 低环境光，解决 V4 画面发灰发白\r\n12: \r\n13: 可编辑性（给手工改场景的人）\r\n14:   - 每个\"组件\"（看台 / 天桥 / 大屏 / 刹车牌组 / 裁判点 / 龙门架+发车灯）有一个 Empty 父物体，\r\n15:     放在组件中心、Z 轴朝向沿赛道方向；选 Empty 按 G/R 就能整体挪动/旋转。\r\n16:   - 重复小零件按\"每座看台每类一个网格\"合并（柱 / 钢梁 / 旗杆 / 旗 / 前立柱），多材质槽保留原材质。\r\n17:   - 所有网格原点都在自身几何中心。\r\n18: \"\"\"\r\n19: import bpy, bmesh, math, os, sys, json, random\r\n20: from mathutils import Vector, Matrix, Euler\r\n21: from math import sin, cos, pi, radians, degrees, atan2, sqrt, hypot\r\n22: \r\n23: PROJ = r\"D:\\项目session\\blender-supercar\"\r\n24: IN = os.path.join(PROJ, \"pipeline\", \"v4_stage_rig.blend\")\r\n25: OUT = os.path.join(PROJ, \"LATEST\", \"v5_stage_env.blend\")\r\n26: TRACK = os.path.join(PROJ, \"track_data\", \"silverstone_track.json\")\r\n27: TEX = os.path.join(PROJ, \"textures\")\r\n28: \r\n29: # ---------------------------------------------------------------\r\n30: # 0. 赛道数据\r\n31: # ---------------------------------------------------------------\r\n32: bpy.ops.wm.open_mainfile(filepath=IN)          # 载入 模型 + 骨架\r\n33: \r\n34: data = json.load(open(TRACK, encoding=\"utf-8\"))\r\n35: META = data[\"meta\"]\r\n36: PTS = data[\"points\"]\r\n37: N = len(PTS)\r\n38: HALF_W = META[\"track_half_width_m\"]          # 7.0 -> 14 m\r\n39: TW = HALF_W * 2\r\n40: \r\n41: S = [p[\"s\"] for p in PTS]\r\n42: XY = [Vector((p[\"xy\"][0], p[\"xy\"][1], 0.0)) for p in PTS]\r\n43: RXY = [Vector((p[\"racing_xy\"][0], p[\"racing_xy\"][1], 0.0)) for p in PTS]\r\n44: ROFF = [p[\"racing_offset_m\"] for p in PTS]\r\n45: KAPPA = [abs(p[\"curv_1pm\"] or 0.0) for p in PTS]        # 无符号曲率\r\n46: VEL = [p[\"v_mps\"] for p in PTS]\r\n47: LAP_LEN = S[-1]\r\n48: \r\n49: \r\n50: def _unwrap(deg_list):\r\n51:     out = [deg_list[0]]\r\n52:     for a in deg_list[1:]:\r\n53:         d = (a - out[-1] + 180.0) % 360.0 - 180.0\r\n54:         out.append(out[-1] + d)\r\n55:     return out\r\n56: \r\n57: \r\n58: HDEG = _unwrap([p[\"heading_deg\"] for p in PTS])          # 展开后的切线角（度，从 +X 逆时针）\r\n59: HEAD = [radians(a) for a in HDEG]\r\n60: \r\n61: # 有符号曲率：曲率幅值取数据，符号取航向的一阶差分（平滑后）\r\n62: _span = 4\r\n63: KSIGN = []\r\n64: for i in range(N):\r\n65:     a = HEAD[(i - _span) % N]\r\n66:     b = HEAD[(i + _span) % N]\r\n67:     ds = 2 * _span * (LAP_LEN / N)\r\n68:     if b - a > pi / 2:      # 跨 ±pi 处理\r\n69:         b -= 2 * pi\r\n70:     KSIGN.append(1.0 if (b - a) >= 0 else -1.0)\r\n71: SIGNED_K = [KSIGN[i] * KAPPA[i] for i in range(N)]\r\n72: \r\n73: \r\n74: def at(i):\r\n75:     \"\"\"第 i 点：位置 / 航向 / 右向 / 曲率\"\"\"\r\n76:     i %= N\r\n77:     h = HEAD[i]\r\n78:     return XY[i], h, Vector((sin(h), -cos(h), 0.0)), SIGNED_K[i]\r\n79: \r\n80: \r\n81: def at_s(s):\r\n82:     s %= LAP_LEN\r\n83:     lo, hi = 0, N - 1\r\n84:     while hi - lo > 1:\r\n85:         m = (lo + hi) // 2\r\n86:         if S[m] <= s:\r\n87:             lo = m\r\n88:         else:\r\n89:             hi = m\r\n90:     f = (s - S[lo]) / max(S[lo + 1] - S[lo], 1e-9)\r\n91:     p = XY[lo].lerp(XY[lo + 1], f)\r\n92:     a, b = HEAD[lo], HEAD[lo + 1]\r\n93:     d = (b - a + pi) % (2 * pi) - pi\r\n94:     h = a + d * f\r\n95:     return p, h, Vector((sin(h), -cos(h), 0.0)), SIGNED_K[lo]\r\n96: \r\n97: \r\n98: # ---------------------------------------------------------------\r\n99: # 1. 工具\r\n100: # ---------------------------------------------------------------\r\n101: scene = bpy.context.scene\r\n102: COLL = scene.collection\r\n103: \r\n104: \r\n105: def _bsdf(mat_or_nt):\r\n106:     \"\"\"按类型取 Principled BSDF（不依赖界面语言的节点显示名）；兼容 material 或 node_tree\"\"\"\r\n107:     nt = getattr(mat_or_nt, 'node_tree', mat_or_nt)\r\n108:     for n in nt.nodes:\r\n109:         if n.type == 'BSDF_PRINCIPLED':\r\n110:             return n\r\n111:     return None\r\n112: \r\n113: \r\n114: def new_mat(name, color, rough=0.5, metal=0.0, emission=None, estrength=0.0):\r\n115:     m = bpy.data.materials.get(name)\r\n116:     if m:\r\n117:         return m\r\n118:     m = bpy.data.materials.new(name)\r\n119:     m.use_nodes = True\r\n120:     b = _bsdf(m)\r\n121:     b.inputs['Base Color'].default_value = (*color, 1)\r\n122:     b.inputs['Roughness'].default_value = rough\r\n123:     b.inputs['Metallic'].default_value = metal\r\n124:     if emission:\r\n125:         b.inputs['Emission Color'].default_value = (*emission, 1)\r\n126:         b.inputs['Emission Strength'].default_value = estrength\r\n127:     return m\r\n128: \r\n129: \r\n130: def fix_normals(ob, up=True):\r\n131:     me = ob.data\r\n132:     bm = bmesh.new()\r\n133:     bm.from_mesh(me)\r\n134:     bmesh.ops.recalc_face_normals(bm, faces=bm.faces)\r\n135:     bm.to_mesh(me)\r\n136:     bm.free()\r\n137:     me.update()\r\n138:     if up and len(me.polygons):\r\n139:         nz = sum(p.normal.z for p in me.polygons)\r\n140:         if nz < 0:\r\n141:             bm = bmesh.new()\r\n142:             bm.from_mesh(me)\r\n143:             bmesh.ops.reverse_faces(bm, faces=bm.faces)\r\n144:             bm.to_mesh(me)\r\n145:             bm.free()\r\n146:             me.update()\r\n147:     return ob\r\n148: \r\n149: \r\n150: def mesh_from(name, verts, faces, mats, face_mat=None, smooth=False, uvs=None, up=True):\r\n151:     me = bpy.data.meshes.new(name)\r\n152:     me.from_pydata(verts, [], faces)\r\n153:     me.validate()\r\n154:     me.update()\r\n155:     ob = bpy.data.objects.new(name, me)\r\n156:     COLL.objects.link(ob)\r\n157:     if not isinstance(mats, (list, tuple)):\r\n158:         mats = [mats]\r\n159:     for m in mats:\r\n160:         me.materials.append(m)\r\n161:     if face_mat:\r\n162:         for p, mi in zip(me.polygons, face_mat):\r\n163:             p.material_index = mi\r\n164:     for p in me.polygons:\r\n165:         p.use_smooth = smooth\r\n166:     if uvs:\r\n167:         uv = me.uv_layers.new(name=\"UVMap\")\r\n168:         for poly in me.polygons:\r\n169:             for li in poly.loop_indices:\r\n170:                 uv.data[li].uv = uvs[me.loops[li].vertex_index]\r\n171:     fix_normals(ob, up=up)\r\n172:     return ob\r\n173: \r\n174: \r\n175: def box(name, center, size, mat, rot_z=0.0, up=False):\r\n176:     bm = bmesh.new()\r\n177:     bmesh.ops.create_cube(bm, size=1.0)\r\n178:     bmesh.ops.scale(bm, vec=size, verts=bm.verts)\r\n179:     me = bpy.data.meshes.new(name)\r\n180:     bm.to_mesh(me)\r\n181:     bm.free()\r\n182:     ob = bpy.data.objects.new(name, me)\r\n183:     COLL.objects.link(ob)\r\n184:     ob.location = center\r\n185:     ob.rotation_euler = (0, 0, rot_z)\r\n186:     me.materials.append(mat)\r\n187:     return ob\r\n188: \r\n189: \r\n190: _CUBE_FACES = [(0, 3, 2, 1), (4, 5, 6, 7), (0, 1, 5, 4), (1, 2, 6, 5), (2, 3, 7, 6), (3, 0, 4, 7)]\r\n191: \r\n192: \r\n193: class Parts:\r\n194:     \"\"\"把一组重复小零件累积成【一个】网格对象（世界坐标烘焙，第 13 步再把原点挪到几何中心）。\r\n195:     每个零件可用不同材质 -> 多材质槽。用法:\r\n196:         P = Parts(\"V5_Stand_Main_Columns\"); P.box(...); P.beam(...); ob = P.build()\r\n197:     \"\"\"\r\n198: \r\n199:     def __init__(self, name):\r\n200:         self.name = name\r\n201:         self.v, self.f, self.fm, self.mats = [], [], [], []\r\n202: \r\n203:     def _mi(self, mat):\r\n204:         if mat not in self.mats:\r\n205:             self.mats.append(mat)\r\n206:         return self.mats.index(mat)\r\n207: \r\n208:     def _cuboid(self, corners, mat):\r\n209:         mi = self._mi(mat)\r\n210:         base = len(self.v)\r\n211:         self.v += [tuple(c) for c in corners]\r\n212:         for fc in _CUBE_FACES:\r\n213:             self.f.append(tuple(base + i for i in fc))\r\n214:             self.fm.append(mi)\r\n215: \r\n216:     def box(self, center, size, mat, rot_z=0.0):\r\n217:         \"\"\"与 box() 同参数：中心 + 尺寸 + 绕 Z 旋转\"\"\"\r\n218:         hx, hy, hz = size[0] / 2.0, size[1] / 2.0, size[2] / 2.0\r\n219:         c, s = cos(rot_z), sin(rot_z)\r\n220:         pts = []\r\n221:         for sz in (-1, 1):\r\n222:             for sx, sy in ((-1, -1), (1, -1), (1, 1), (-1, 1)):\r\n223:                 x, y = sx * hx, sy * hy\r\n224:                 pts.append((center[0] + x * c - y * s, center[1] + x * s + y * c, center[2] + sz * hz))\r\n225:         self._cuboid(pts, mat)\r\n226: \r\n227:     def beam(self, a, b, side, w, hgt, mat):\r\n228:         \"\"\"从 a 到 b 的方截面梁；side = 水平横向单位向量，截面 w(横) x hgt(竖)\"\"\"\r\n229:         a, b = Vector(a), Vector(b)\r\n230:         sv = Vector(side).normalized() * (w / 2.0)\r\n231:         uv = Vector((0.0, 0.0, hgt / 2.0))\r\n232:         pts = []\r\n233:         for e in (a, b):\r\n234:             pts += [e - sv - uv, e + sv - uv, e + sv + uv, e - sv + uv]\r\n235:         self._cuboid(pts, mat)\r\n236: \r\n237:     def poly(self, verts, faces, mat):\r\n238:         mi = self._mi(mat)\r\n239:         base = len(self.v)\r\n240:         self.v += [tuple(p) for p in verts]\r\n241:         for fc in faces:\r\n242:             self.f.append(tuple(base + i for i in fc))\r\n243:             self.fm.append(mi)\r\n244: \r\n245:     def build(self, up=False):\r\n246:         if not self.f:\r\n247:             return None\r\n248:         ob = mesh_from(self.name, self.v, self.f, self.mats, face_mat=self.fm, up=up)\r\n249:         if up:      # 多个互不相连的平面片：逐面保证朝上（recalc 只能保证每个岛内一致）\r\n250:             me = ob.data\r\n251:             bm = bmesh.new()\r\n252:             bm.from_mesh(me)\r\n253:             bm.normal_update()\r\n254:             down = [f for f in bm.faces if f.normal.z < 0]\r\n255:             if down:\r\n256:                 bmesh.ops.reverse_faces(bm, faces=down)\r\n257:                 bm.to_mesh(me)\r\n258:                 me.update()\r\n259:             bm.free()\r\n260:         return ob\r\n261: \r\n262: \r\n263: # 组件 Empty：(empty, [子物体])；第 13 步原点归位之后统一挂父子关系（保持世界变换）\r\n264: ASSEMBLIES = []\r\n265: \r\n266: \r\n267: def assembly(name, center, heading, parts, size=4.0):\r\n268:     em = bpy.data.objects.new(name, None)\r\n269:     em.empty_display_type = 'ARROWS'\r\n270:     em.empty_display_size = size\r\n271:     COLL.objects.link(em)\r\n272:     em.location = (center[0], center[1], center[2] if len(center) > 2 else 0.0)\r\n273:     em.rotation_euler = (0.0, 0.0, heading)\r\n274:     ASSEMBLIES.append((em, [p for p in parts if p is not None]))\r\n275:     return em\r\n276: \r\n277: \r\n278: # ---------------------------------------------------------------\r\n279: # 2. 材质\r\n280: # ---------------------------------------------------------------\r\n281: _cx = sum(v.x for v in XY) / N\r\n282: _cy = sum(v.y for v in XY) / N\r\n283: \r\n284: M_ASPHALT = new_mat(\"V5_Asphalt\", (0.026, 0.026, 0.028), 0.84)\r\n285: M_RUBBER = new_mat(\"V5_RubberLine\", (0.0215, 0.0218, 0.0232), 0.76)\r\n286: M_WHITE = new_mat(\"V5_WhiteLine\", (0.68, 0.68, 0.66), 0.60)\r\n287: M_GRASS = new_mat(\"V5_Grass\", (0.038, 0.062, 0.026), 0.92)\r\n288: M_GRAVEL = new_mat(\"V5_Gravel\", (0.30, 0.26, 0.20), 0.95)\r\n289: M_CURB_R = new_mat(\"V5_CurbRed\", (0.52, 0.030, 0.028), 0.55)\r\n290: M_CURB_W = new_mat(\"V5_CurbWhite\", (0.74, 0.74, 0.72), 0.55)\r\n291: M_BARRIER = new_mat(\"V5_Barrier\", (0.055, 0.058, 0.065), 0.48, 0.25)\r\n292: M_CONC = new_mat(\"V5_Concrete\", (0.24, 0.24, 0.245), 0.72)\r\n293: M_STEEL = new_mat(\"V5_Steel\", (0.09, 0.095, 0.105), 0.42, 0.75)\r\n294: M_STRIP = new_mat(\"V5_LightStrip\", (0.02, 0.06, 0.07), 0.4,\r\n295:                   emission=(0.05, 0.85, 1.0), estrength=7.5)\r\n296: M_CROWD = new_mat(\"V5_Crowd\", (0.035, 0.035, 0.042), 0.92)\r\n297: M_ROOF = new_mat(\"V5_Roof\", (0.10, 0.11, 0.12), 0.55, 0.3)\r\n298: M_HANGAR = new_mat(\"V5_Hangar\", (0.14, 0.15, 0.16), 0.75)\r\n299: M_ADPANEL = new_mat(\"V5_AdPanel\", (0.02, 0.05, 0.13), 0.5,\r\n300:                     emission=(0.06, 0.55, 0.9), estrength=2.2)\r\n301: \r\n302: # 沥青：程序化颗粒 + 补丁色差\r\n303: # 纹理坐标用【世界坐标】(Geometry.Position)，不用 Object 坐标：\r\n304: # 第 13 步会把原点挪到几何中心，若用 Object 坐标，颗粒/补丁/割草条纹会跟着平移、\r\n305: # 和 11/14 成片（当时原点在世界原点）对不上；世界坐标也让挪物体时纹理不跟着滑。\r\n306: _am = M_ASPHALT.node_tree\r\n307: _ab = _bsdf(_am)\r\n308: _ab.inputs['Specular IOR Level'].default_value = 0.0\r\n309: _tc = _am.nodes.new('ShaderNodeNewGeometry')\r\n310: _n1 = _am.nodes.new('ShaderNodeTexNoise')\r\n311: _n1.inputs['Scale'].default_value = 120.0\r\n312: _n1.inputs['Detail'].default_value = 12.0\r\n313: _n1.inputs['Roughness'].default_value = 0.75\r\n314: _bp = _am.nodes.new('ShaderNodeBump')\r\n315: _bp.inputs['Strength'].default_value = 0.22\r\n316: _am.links.new(_tc.outputs['Position'], _n1.inputs['Vector'])\r\n317: _am.links.new(_n1.outputs['Fac'], _bp.inputs['Height'])\r\n318: _am.links.new(_bp.outputs['Normal'], _ab.inputs['Normal'])\r\n319: # 大尺度补丁（沥青翻新/油污）\r\n320: _n2 = _am.nodes.new('ShaderNodeTexNoise')\r\n321: _n2.inputs['Scale'].default_value = 0.35\r\n322: _n2.inputs['Detail'].default_value = 5.0\r\n323: _mix = _am.nodes.new('ShaderNodeMixRGB')\r\n324: _mix.blend_type = 'MIX'\r\n325: _mix.inputs['Color1'].default_value = (0.0330, 0.0332, 0.0355, 1)\r\n326: _mix.inputs['Color2'].default_value = (0.0580, 0.0565, 0.0570, 1)\r\n327: _mix.inputs['Fac'].default_value = 0.5\r\n328: _am.links.new(_tc.outputs['Position'], _n2.inputs['Vector'])\r\n329: _am.links.new(_n2.outputs['Fac'], _mix.inputs['Fac'])\r\n330: _am.links.new(_mix.outputs['Color'], _ab.inputs['Base Color'])\r\n331: \r\n332: # 所有路面相关材质压掉镜面（防低角度太阳反光）\r\n333: for _mn in (\"V5_RubberLine\", \"V5_WhiteLine\", \"V5_CurbRed\", \"V5_CurbWhite\", \"V5_Gravel\"):\r\n334:     _mm = bpy.data.materials.get(_mn)\r\n335:     if _mm and _mm.node_tree:\r\n336:         _bb = _bsdf(_mm)\r\n337:         if _bb and 'Specular IOR Level' in _bb.inputs:\r\n338:             _bb.inputs['Specular IOR Level'].default_value = 0.03\r\n339: \r\n340: # 草地：噪波色差\r\n341: _gm = M_GRASS.node_tree\r\n342: _gb = _bsdf(_gm)\r\n343: _gb.inputs['Specular IOR Level'].default_value = 0.15\r\n344: _gtc = _gm.nodes.new('ShaderNodeNewGeometry')          # 世界坐标，理由同沥青\r\n345: _gn = _gm.nodes.new('ShaderNodeTexNoise')\r\n346: _gn.inputs['Scale'].default_value = 2.2\r\n347: _gn.inputs['Detail'].default_value = 9.0\r\n348: _gmix = _gm.nodes.new('ShaderNodeMixRGB')\r\n349: _gmix.inputs['Color1'].default_value = (0.036, 0.056, 0.024, 1)\r\n350: _gmix.inputs['Color2'].default_value = (0.062, 0.086, 0.036, 1)\r\n351: _gmix.inputs['Fac'].default_value = 0.5\r\n352: _gm.links.new(_gtc.outputs['Position'], _gn.inputs['Vector'])\r\n353: _gm.links.new(_gn.outputs['Fac'], _gmix.inputs['Fac'])\r\n354: # 割草条纹（机场草坪特征）：沿世界 X 的方波，8 m 一条\r\n355: _gsep = _gm.nodes.new('ShaderNodeSeparateXYZ')\r\n356: _gm.links.new(_gtc.outputs['Position'], _gsep.inputs['Vector'])\r\n357: _gmul = _gm.nodes.new('ShaderNodeMath')\r\n358: _gmul.operation = 'MULTIPLY'\r\n359: _gmul.inputs[1].default_value = 6.28318 / 16.0\r\n360: _gm.links.new(_gsep.outputs['X'], _gmul.inputs[0])\r\n361: _gsin = _gm.nodes.new('ShaderNodeMath')\r\n362: _gsin.operation = 'SINE'\r\n363: _gm.links.new(_gmul.outputs['Value'], _gsin.inputs[0])\r\n364: _gstripe = _gm.nodes.new('ShaderNodeMath')\r\n365: _gstripe.operation = 'MULTIPLY'\r\n366: _gstripe.inputs[1].default_value = 0.55\r\n367: _gm.links.new(_gsin.outputs['Value'], _gstripe.inputs[0])\r\n368: _gadd = _gm.nodes.new('ShaderNodeMath')\r\n369: _gadd.operation = 'ADD'\r\n370: _gadd.inputs[1].default_value = 1.0\r\n371: _gm.links.new(_gstripe.outputs['Value'], _gadd.inputs[0])\r\n372: _gmul2 = _gm.nodes.new('ShaderNodeMixRGB')\r\n373: _gmul2.blend_type = 'MULTIPLY'\r\n374: _gmul2.inputs['Fac'].default_value = 1.0\r\n375: _gm.links.new(_gmix.outputs['Color'], _gmul2.inputs['Color1'])\r\n376: _gm.links.new(_gadd.outputs['Value'], _gmul2.inputs['Color2'])\r\n377: _gm.links.new(_gmul2.outputs['Color'], _gb.inputs['Base Color'])\r\n378: _gbump = _gm.nodes.new('ShaderNodeBump')\r\n379: _gbump.inputs['Strength'].default_value = 0.25\r\n380: _gm.links.new(_gn.outputs['Fac'], _gbump.inputs['Height'])\r\n381: _gm.links.new(_gbump.outputs['Normal'], _gb.inputs['Normal'])\r\n382: \r\n383: # 看台人群贴图\r\n384: _crowd_img = None\r\n385: _p = os.path.join(TEX, \"crowd_silverstone.png\")\r\n386: if os.path.exists(_p):\r\n387:     _crowd_img = bpy.data.images.load(_p, check_existing=True)\r\n388:     _cm = M_CROWD.node_tree\r\n389:     _cb = _bsdf(_cm)\r\n390:     _ctex = _cm.nodes.new('ShaderNodeTexImage')\r\n391:     _ctex.image = _crowd_img\r\n392:     _ctex.extension = 'REPEAT'\r\n393:     _cm.links.new(_ctex.outputs['Color'], _cb.inputs['Base Color'])\r\n394:     _cm.links.new(_ctex.outputs['Color'], _cb.inputs['Emission Color'])\r\n395:     _cb.inputs['Emission Strength'].default_value = 0.55\r\n396: \r\n397: \r\n398: # ---------------------------------------------------------------\r\n399: # 2b. 贴图材质（维修区 / 广告板 / 刹车牌 / 大屏）\r\n400: # ---------------------------------------------------------------\r\n401: def tex_mat(name, img_file, emission=0.0, spec=0.0, rough=0.7):\r\n402:     m = bpy.data.materials.get(name) or bpy.data.materials.new(name)\r\n403:     m.use_nodes = True\r\n404:     nt = m.node_tree\r\n405:     nt.nodes.clear()\r\n406:     b = nt.nodes.new(\"ShaderNodeBsdfPrincipled\")\r\n407:     b.inputs['Specular IOR Level'].default_value = spec\r\n408:     b.inputs['Roughness'].default_value = rough\r\n409:     tex = nt.nodes.new('ShaderNodeTexImage')\r\n410:     img = bpy.data.images.load(os.path.join(TEX, img_file), check_existing=True)\r\n411:     tex.image = img\r\n412:     tex.extension = 'REPEAT'\r\n413:     nt.links.new(tex.outputs['Color'], b.inputs['Base Color'])\r\n414:     if emission > 0:\r\n415:         nt.links.new(tex.outputs['Color'], b.inputs['Emission Color'])\r\n416:         b.inputs['Emission Strength'].default_value = emission\r\n417:     out = nt.nodes.new('ShaderNodeOutputMaterial')\r\n418:     nt.links.new(b.outputs['BSDF'], out.inputs['Surface'])\r\n419:     return m, img\r\n420: \r\n421: \r\n422: M_GARAGE, _garage_img = tex_mat(\"V5_PitGarage\", \"pit_garage.png\", emission=0.18, spec=0.05, rough=0.6)\r\n423: M_AD, _ad_img = tex_mat(\"V5_AdBoard\", \"ad_boards.png\", emission=0.75, spec=0.05, rough=0.55)\r\n424: M_SCREEN, _screen_img = tex_mat(\"V5_BigScreen\", \"bigscreen.png\", emission=1.6, spec=0.05, rough=0.4)\r\n425: M_BRAKE = {}\r\n426: for _n in (\"150\", \"100\", \"50\"):\r\n427:     M_BRAKE[_n], _ = tex_mat(f\"V5_Brake{_n}\", f\"brake_{_n}.png\", emission=0.12, spec=0.1, rough=0.5)\r\n428: \r\n429: # ---------------------------------------------------------------\r\n430: # 3. 天空 / 太阳（重做对比度）\r\n431: # ---------------------------------------------------------------\r\n432: world = bpy.data.worlds.get(\"World_V5Dusk\") or bpy.data.worlds.new(\"World_V5Dusk\")\r\n433: scene.world = world\r\n434: world.use_nodes = True\r\n435: _nt = world.node_tree\r\n436: _nt.nodes.clear()\r\n437: _bg = _nt.nodes.new('ShaderNodeBackground')\r\n438: _bg.inputs['Color'].default_value = (0.055, 0.075, 0.130, 1)\r\n439: _bg.inputs['Strength'].default_value = 1.15\r\n440: _wo = _nt.nodes.new('ShaderNodeOutputWorld')\r\n441: _nt.links.new(_bg.outputs[0], _wo.inputs[0])\r\n442: \r\n443: _sl = bpy.data.lights.new(\"LGT_V5Sun\", 'SUN')\r\n444: _sl.energy = 5.6\r\n445: _sl.angle = radians(1.4)\r\n446: _sl.color = (1.0, 0.86, 0.70)\r\n447: _sl.use_shadow = True\r\n448: _sun = bpy.data.objects.new(\"LGT_V5Sun\", _sl)\r\n449: COLL.objects.link(_sun)\r\n450: # 与天空 sun_rotation 对齐：方位 232° → 光从西南低角入射\r\n451: _az = radians(232.0)\r\n452: _sun.rotation_euler = Euler((radians(90.0 - 22.0), 0.0, _az - pi / 2), 'XYZ')\r\n453: \r\n454: # 冷补光（天空反向，抬暗部，避免死黑）\r\n455: _fill = bpy.data.lights.new(\"LGT_V5SkyFill\", 'SUN')\r\n456: _fill.energy = 0.45\r\n457: _fill.angle = radians(25.0)\r\n458: _fill.color = (0.55, 0.70, 1.0)\r\n459: _fill.use_shadow = False\r\n460: _fo = bpy.data.objects.new(\"LGT_V5SkyFill\", _fill)\r\n461: COLL.objects.link(_fo)\r\n462: _fo.rotation_euler = Euler((radians(52.0), 0.0, _az + pi / 2), 'XYZ')\r\n463: \r\n464: # ---------------------------------------------------------------\r\n465: # ---------------------------------------------------------------\r\n466: # 3b. 天空穹顶：黄昏渐变（顶点色自发光）\r\n467: # ---------------------------------------------------------------\r\n468: _sky_mat = bpy.data.materials.new(\"V5_SkyDome\")\r\n469: _sky_mat.use_nodes = True\r\n470: _snt = _sky_mat.node_tree\r\n471: _snt.nodes.clear()\r\n472: _sout = _snt.nodes.new('ShaderNodeOutputMaterial')\r\n473: _sem = _snt.nodes.new('ShaderNodeEmission')\r\n474: _sem.inputs['Strength'].default_value = 1.0\r\n475: _svc = _snt.nodes.new('ShaderNodeVertexColor')\r\n476: _svc.layer_name = \"Col\"\r\n477: _snt.links.new(_svc.outputs['Color'], _sem.inputs['Color'])\r\n478: _snt.links.new(_sem.outputs['Emission'], _sout.inputs['Surface'])\r\n479: \r\n480: _bm = bmesh.new()\r\n481: try:\r\n482:     bmesh.ops.create_uvsphere(_bm, u_segments=64, v_segments=32, radius=1.0)\r\n483: except TypeError:\r\n484:     bmesh.ops.create_uvsphere(_bm, u_segments=64, v_segments=32, diameter=1.0)\r\n485: _mesh = bpy.data.meshes.new(\"V5_SkyDome\")\r\n486: _bm.to_mesh(_mesh)\r\n487: _bm.free()\r\n488: _ca = _mesh.color_attributes.new(name=\"Col\", type='FLOAT_COLOR', domain='POINT')\r\n489: \r\n490: \r\n491: def _sky_color(z):\r\n492:     stops = [(-0.10, (0.030, 0.026, 0.024)),\r\n493:              (0.000, (0.60, 0.30, 0.16)),\r\n494:              (0.030, (0.33, 0.19, 0.20)),\r\n495:              (0.110, (0.13, 0.17, 0.30)),\r\n496:              (0.300, (0.045, 0.085, 0.200)),\r\n497:              (0.650, (0.016, 0.038, 0.115)),\r\n498:              (1.000, (0.008, 0.020, 0.070))]\r\n499:     if z <= stops[0][0]:\r\n500:         return stops[0][1]\r\n501:     for _k in range(len(stops) - 1):\r\n502:         z0, c0 = stops[_k]\r\n503:         z1, c1 = stops[_k + 1]\r\n504:         if z0 <= z <= z1:\r\n505:             f = (z - z0) / max(z1 - z0, 1e-9)\r\n506:             f = f * f * (3 - 2 * f)\r\n507:             return tuple(c0[j] + (c1[j] - c0[j]) * f for j in range(3))\r\n508:     return stops[-1][1]\r\n509: \r\n510: \r\n511: for _i, _v in enumerate(_mesh.vertices):\r\n512:     _r, _g, _b = _sky_color(_v.co.z)\r\n513:     _ca.data[_i].color = (_r, _g, _b, 1.0)\r\n514: \r\n515: _skyob = bpy.data.objects.new(\"V5_SkyDome\", _mesh)\r\n516: COLL.objects.link(_skyob)\r\n517: _skyob.location = (_cx, _cy, 0.0)\r\n518: _skyob.scale = (4200.0, 4200.0, 4200.0)\r\n519: _skyob.visible_shadow = False\r\n520: _mesh.materials.append(_sky_mat)\r\n521: \r\n522: # 4. 地面\r\n523: # ---------------------------------------------------------------\r\n524: GR = 2600.0\r\n525: mesh_from(\"V5_Ground\", [(_cx - GR, _cy - GR, -0.004), (_cx + GR, _cy - GR, -0.004),\r\n526:                         (_cx + GR, _cy + GR, -0.004), (_cx - GR, _cy + GR, -0.004)],\r\n527:           [(0, 1, 2, 3)], M_GRASS)\r\n528: \r\n529: # ---------------------------------------------------------------\r\n530: # 5. 路面 / 赛车线 / 边线\r\n531: # ---------------------------------------------------------------\r\n532: def ribbon(off_a, off_b, z, mat, name, step=1, ups=True, uv_scale=None):\r\n533:     \"\"\"沿中心线生成带状网格；off 为右向偏移（m），可为常数或 f(i)；首尾自动闭合\"\"\"\r\n534:     v, fc, uv = [], [], []\r\n535:     idxs = list(range(0, N, step))\r\n536:     if idxs[-1] != N - 1:\r\n537:         idxs.append(N - 1)\r\n538:     idxs.append(N)                              # at(N) -> 第 0 点，闭环\r\n539:     fa = off_a if callable(off_a) else (lambda i: off_a)\r\n540:     fb = off_b if callable(off_b) else (lambda i: off_b)\r\n541:     for i in idxs:\r\n542:         p, h, r, k = at(i)\r\n543:         a, b = fa(i), fb(i)\r\n544:         v.append((p.x + r.x * a, p.y + r.y * a, z))\r\n545:         v.append((p.x + r.x * b, p.y + r.y * b, z))\r\n546:         if uv_scale:\r\n547:             uv.append((0.0, S[i % N] / uv_scale))\r\n548:             uv.append((1.0, S[i % N] / uv_scale))\r\n549:     for j in range(len(idxs) - 1):\r\n550:         a = j * 2\r\n551:         fc.append((a, a + 1, a + 3, a + 2))\r\n552:     return mesh_from(name, v, fc, mat, uvs=uv if uv_scale else None, up=ups)\r\n553: \r\n554: \r\n555: # 主路面\r\n556: ribbon(-HALF_W, HALF_W, 0.010, M_ASPHALT, \"V5_Track\", uv_scale=8.0)\r\n557: # 边线（白实线）\r\n558: ribbon(-HALF_W + 0.05, -HALF_W + 0.20, 0.014, M_WHITE, \"V5_Line_L\")\r\n559: ribbon(HALF_W - 0.20, HALF_W - 0.05, 0.014, M_WHITE, \"V5_Line_R\")\r\n560: \r\n561: # 赛车线橡胶带（沿 racing_xy，宽 3.4 m）\r\n562: def _rl(i):\r\n563:     return ROFF[i % N] - 1.7\r\n564: \r\n565: \r\n566: def _rr(i):\r\n567:     return ROFF[i % N] + 1.7\r\n568: \r\n569: \r\n570: ribbon(_rl, _rr, 0.013, M_RUBBER, \"V5_RacingLine\", step=1)\r\n571: \r\n572: # ---------------------------------------------------------------\r\n573: # 6. 路肩（弯道）\r\n574: # ---------------------------------------------------------------\r\n575: def corner_runs(thresh=0.0045, min_len=18.0, gap=8.0):\r\n576:     runs, cur = [], None\r\n577:     for i in range(N):\r\n578:         if KAPPA[i] > thresh:\r\n579:             if cur is None:\r\n580:                 cur = [i, i]\r\n581:             else:\r\n582:                 cur[1] = i\r\n583:         else:\r\n584:             if cur and S[cur[1]] - S[cur[0]] >= min_len:\r\n585:                 runs.append(tuple(cur))\r\n586:             cur = None\r\n587:     if cur and LAP_LEN - S[cur[0]] + S[cur[1]] >= min_len:\r\n588:         runs.append((cur[0], cur[1]))\r\n589:     # 合并近邻（同一弯的碎段）\r\n590:     merged = []\r\n591:     for r in runs:\r\n592:         if merged and S[r[0]] - S[merged[-1][1]] < gap:\r\n593:             merged[-1] = (merged[-1][0], r[1])\r\n594:         else:\r\n595:             merged.append(list(r))\r\n596:     return [(a, b) for a, b in merged]\r\n597: \r\n598: \r\n599: KERB_IN_W = 1.35\r\n600: KERB_Z_IN = 0.012\r\n601: KERB_Z_OUT = 0.075\r\n602: BLOCK_M = 3.2\r\n603: \r\n604: _runs = corner_runs()\r\n605: print(\"corner runs:\", len(_runs))\r\n606: \r\n607: \r\n608: def build_kerb(i0, i1, side, mat, phase, name):\r\n609:     \"\"\"沿弯道内侧/外侧生成路肩块（红白交替，按全局弧长对齐）\"\"\"\r\n610:     s0, s1 = S[i0], S[i1]\r\n611:     v, fc = [], []\r\n612:     s = s0 - ((s0 / BLOCK_M) % 1.0) * BLOCK_M\r\n613:     while s < s1 - 0.3:\r\n614:         kb = int(round(s / BLOCK_M))\r\n615:         if kb % 2 == phase:\r\n616:             a0 = max(s0, s)\r\n617:             a1 = min(s1, s + BLOCK_M)\r\n618:             if a1 - a0 > 0.5:\r\n619:                 base = len(v)\r\n620:                 for ss in (a0, a1):\r\n621:                     p, h, r, k = at_s(ss)\r\n622:                     o0 = side * HALF_W\r\n623:                     o1 = side * (HALF_W + KERB_IN_W)\r\n624:                     v.append((p.x + r.x * o0, p.y + r.y * o0, KERB_Z_IN))\r\n625:                     v.append((p.x + r.x * o1, p.y + r.y * o1, KERB_Z_OUT))\r\n626:                 fc.append((base, base + 1, base + 3, base + 2))\r\n627:         s += BLOCK_M\r\n628:     if fc:\r\n629:         return mesh_from(name, v, fc, mat)\r\n630: \r\n631: \r\n632: for ki, (a, b) in enumerate(_runs):\r\n633:     # 内外侧都铺（真实赛道：apex 内侧 + 出弯外侧）\r\n634:     for side, nm in ((-1, \"L\"), (1, \"R\")):\r\n635:         build_kerb(a, b, side, M_CURB_R, 0, f\"V5_Kerb_{ki}_{nm}_R\")\r\n636:         build_kerb(a, b, side, M_CURB_W, 1, f\"V5_Kerb_{ki}_{nm}_W\")\r\n637: \r\n638: # ---------------------------------------------------------------\r\n639: # 7. 缓冲带（草地 / 砾石）\r\n640: # ---------------------------------------------------------------\r\n641: VERGE_W = 26.0\r\n642: ribbon(-HALF_W - KERB_IN_W, -HALF_W - VERGE_W, 0.004, M_GRASS, \"V5_Verge_L\", step=2)\r\n643: ribbon(HALF_W + KERB_IN_W, HALF_W + VERGE_W, 0.004, M_GRASS, \"V5_Verge_R\", step=2)\r\n644: \r\n645: # 砾石坑：慢弯外侧\r\n646: GRAV_OUT = 22.0\r\n647: \r\n648: \r\n649: def build_gravel(i0, i1, side, name):\r\n650:     v, fc = [], []\r\n651:     step = 2\r\n652:     idxs = list(range(i0, i1, step))\r\n653:     for i in idxs:\r\n654:         p, h, r, k = at(i)\r\n655:         for o, z in ((side * (HALF_W + KERB_IN_W), 0.006), (side * GRAV_OUT, 0.006)):\r\n656:             v.append((p.x + r.x * o, p.y + r.y * o, z))\r\n657:     for j in range(len(idxs) - 1):\r\n658:         a = j * 2\r\n659:         fc.append((a, a + 1, a + 3, a + 2))\r\n660:     if fc:\r\n661:         return mesh_from(name, v, fc, M_GRAVEL)\r\n662: \r\n663: \r\n664: _gi = 0\r\n665: for (a, b) in _runs:\r\n666:     vmin = min(VEL[a:b + 1]) * 3.6\r\n667:     if vmin < 180 and (b - a) > 12:\r\n668:         side = 1 if SIGNED_K[a] > 0 else -1    # 弯外侧 = 转向的反侧\r\n669:         build_gravel(a, b, side, f\"V5_Gravel_{_gi}\")\r\n670:         _gi += 1\r\n671: print(\"gravel traps:\", _gi)\r\n672: \r\n673: # ---------------------------------------------------------------\r\n674: # 8. 护栏 + 灯带 + 防护网\r\n675: # ---------------------------------------------------------------\r\n676: WALL_OFF = HALF_W + VERGE_W            # 33 m\r\n677: WALL_H = 1.05\r\n678: BASE_H = 0.24\r\n679: \r\n680: \r\n681: def _wall_band(z0, z1, off, mat, name):\r\n682:     wv, wf = [], []\r\n683:     for side in (-1, 1):\r\n684:         base = len(wv)\r\n685:         for i in range(N):\r\n686:             p, h, r, k = at(i)\r\n687:             o = side * off\r\n688:             px, py = p.x + r.x * o, p.y + r.y * o\r\n689:             wv.append((px, py, z0))\r\n690:             wv.append((px, py, z1))\r\n691:         for j in range(N):\r\n692:             aa = base + j * 2\r\n693:             bb = base + ((j + 1) % N) * 2\r\n694:             wf.append((aa, aa + 1, bb + 1, bb))\r\n695:             wf.append((bb, bb + 1, aa + 1, aa))\r\n696:     return mesh_from(name, wv, wf, mat, up=False)\r\n697: \r\n698: \r\n699: _wall_band(0.0, BASE_H, WALL_OFF, M_CONC, \"V5_BarrierBase\")\r\n700: _wall_band(BASE_H, WALL_H, WALL_OFF + 0.04, M_BARRIER, \"V5_Barrier\")\r\n701: \r\n702: # 顶部灯带\r\n703: _sv, _sf = [], []\r\n704: for side in (-1, 1):\r\n705:     base = len(_sv)\r\n706:     for i in range(N):\r\n707:         p, h, r, k = at(i)\r\n708:         o = side * (WALL_OFF - 0.02)\r\n709:         px, py = p.x + r.x * o, p.y + r.y * o\r\n710:         _sv.append((px, py, WALL_H - 0.10))\r\n711:         _sv.append((px, py, WALL_H - 0.02))\r\n712:     for j in range(N):\r\n713:         a = base + j * 2\r\n714:         b = base + ((j + 1) % N) * 2\r\n715:         _sf.append((a, a + 1, b + 1, b))\r\n716:         _sf.append((b, b + 1, a + 1, a))\r\n717: mesh_from(\"V5_BarrierStrip\", _sv, _sf, M_STRIP, up=False)\r\n718: \r\n719: # 防护网立柱（每 12 m 一根薄板柱：沿切线 ±0.07 m 宽 0.14 m，高 3.4 m；全部在一个网格里）\r\n720: _pv, _pf = [], []\r\n721: POST_STEP = 12.0\r\n722: for side in (-1, 1):\r\n723:     s = 0.0\r\n724:     while s < LAP_LEN:\r\n725:         p, h, r, k = at_s(s)\r\n726:         o = side * (WALL_OFF + 0.35)\r\n727:         px, py = p.x + r.x * o, p.y + r.y * o\r\n728:         tx, ty = cos(h), sin(h)                    # 切线方向\r\n729:         base = len(_pv)\r\n730:         for d in (-0.07, 0.07):\r\n731:             _pv.append((px + tx * d, py + ty * d, WALL_H))\r\n732:             _pv.append((px + tx * d, py + ty * d, WALL_H + 3.4))\r\n733:         _pf.append((base, base + 1, base + 3, base + 2))\r\n734:         s += POST_STEP\r\n735: mesh_from(\"V5_FencePosts\", _pv, _pf, M_STEEL, up=False)\r\n736: \r\n737: # ---------------------------------------------------------------\r\n738: # 9. 起跑龙门架 + 发车灯 + 起跑线\r\n739: # ---------------------------------------------------------------\r\n740: SF_S = 40.0                     # 起终点位置（沿中心线弧长）\r\n741: gp, gh, gr, gk = at_s(SF_S)\r\n742: \r\n743: # 路面方格线\r\n744: _gv, _gf = [], []\r\n745: for k in range(2):\r\n746:     _gv.append((gp.x + gr.x * (-HALF_W), gp.y + gr.y * (-HALF_W), 0.016))\r\n747:     _gv.append((gp.x + gr.x * (HALF_W), gp.y + gr.y * (HALF_W), 0.016))\r\n748:     gp2, gh2, gr2, _ = at_s(SF_S + (k + 1) * 0.6)\r\n749:     _gv.append((gp2.x + gr2.x * (-HALF_W), gp2.y + gr2.y * (-HALF_W), 0.016))\r\n750:     _gv.append((gp2.x + gr2.x * (HALF_W), gp2.y + gr2.y * (HALF_W), 0.016))\r\n751: for k in range(2):\r\n752:     a = k * 4\r\n753:     _gf.append((a, a + 1, a + 3, a + 2))\r\n754: mesh_from(\"V5_StartLine\", _gv, _gf, M_WHITE)\r\n755: \r\n756: # 门架（组件 Empty: V5_Gantry，含立柱/横梁/横幅/5 盏发车灯）\r\n757: GANT_H = 7.2\r\n758: _gant_parts = []\r\n759: for sd, nm in ((-1, \"L\"), (1, \"R\")):\r\n760:     px = gp.x + gr.x * sd * (HALF_W + 1.6)\r\n761:     py = gp.y + gr.y * sd * (HALF_W + 1.6)\r\n762:     _gant_parts.append(box(f\"V5_Gantry_Post_{nm}\", (px, py, GANT_H / 2), (0.45, 0.45, GANT_H), M_STEEL, rot_z=gh))\r\n763: _gant_parts.append(box(\"V5_Gantry_Beam\", (gp.x, gp.y, GANT_H), (HALF_W * 2 + 3.6, 0.55, 0.85), M_STEEL, rot_z=gh))\r\n764: _gant_parts.append(box(\"V5_Gantry_Banner\", (gp.x - sin(gh) * 0.32, gp.y + cos(gh) * 0.32, GANT_H),\r\n765:                        (HALF_W * 2 + 2.2, 0.06, 0.6), M_ADPANEL, rot_z=gh))\r\n766: \r\n767: # 5 盏发车灯（红灯；v5_anim 里把材质发光压到 0 = 常暗）\r\n768: M_SLIGHT = new_mat(\"V5_StartLight\", (0.06, 0.004, 0.003), 0.3,\r\n769:                    emission=(1.0, 0.05, 0.02), estrength=18.0)\r\n770: for i in range(5):\r\n771:     ox = -1.6 + i * 0.8\r\n772:     px = gp.x + gr.x * ox\r\n773:     py = gp.y + gr.y * ox\r\n774:     bm = bmesh.new()\r\n775:     bmesh.ops.create_uvsphere(bm, u_segments=16, v_segments=10, radius=0.18)\r\n776:     me = bpy.data.meshes.new(f\"V5_StartLight_{i}\")\r\n777:     bm.to_mesh(me)\r\n778:     bm.free()\r\n779:     ob = bpy.data.objects.new(f\"V5_StartLight_{i}\", me)\r\n780:     COLL.objects.link(ob)\r\n781:     ob.location = (px, py, GANT_H - 0.62)\r\n782:     me.materials.append(M_SLIGHT)\r\n783:     _gant_parts.append(ob)\r\n784: assembly(\"V5_Gantry\", (gp.x, gp.y, 0.0), gh, _gant_parts, size=6.0)\r\n785: \r\n786: # ---------------------------------------------------------------\r\n787: # 10. 看台（含人群贴图）\r\n788: # ---------------------------------------------------------------\r\n789: def grandstand(s_center, side, length, rows=11, dist=30.0, name=\"Stand\"):\r\n790:     \"\"\"一座看台 = 一个 Empty(name) + 子物体:\r\n791:        _Tier{i} 阶梯块 / _Back 后墙 / _VIP 玻璃带 / _Roof 顶棚 / _RoofStrip 灯带 / _Rail 前沿围栏\r\n792:        _Columns 后支撑柱(合并) / _Trusses 顶棚横向钢梁(合并) / _FrontPosts 前立柱(合并)\r\n793:        _Flagpoles 旗杆(合并) / _Flags 旗(合并, 多材质)\"\"\"\r\n794:     p, h, r, k = at_s(s_center)\r\n795:     fwd = Vector((cos(h), sin(h), 0.0))\r\n796:     out = Vector((r.x, r.y, 0.0)) * side\r\n797:     row_d = 0.92\r\n798:     row_h = 0.58\r\n799:     L = length / 2.0\r\n800:     parts = []\r"}
